---
import '../styles/app.css'
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro'
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant-TW">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#143b63" />
    <meta name="description" content="找不到指定的租賃住宅管理人員題庫頁面。" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <title>找不到頁面｜租賃住宅管理人員題庫練習</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="single-column">
      <section class="card">
        <p class="eyebrow">404</p>
        <h1>找不到這個頁面</h1>
        <p>網址可能已變更，或頁面不存在。你可以返回題庫入口，重新選擇初訓或換證題庫。</p>
        <div class="question-bank-actions">
          <a class="button" href="/">返回題庫入口</a>
          <a class="button secondary-button" href="/about/">查看關於本站</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <SiteFooter />
  </body>
</html>
